su name headquarters briefing policy be map def
  su name identity ob text "headquarters-briefing-v1" ya
  su name maximum items ob num 5 ya
  su name imminent horizon hours ob num 24 ya
  su name category precedence ob ve text "pending approval/decision" "explicit escalation" "overdue deadline" "deadline within horizon" "explicit reconciliation/conflict" "blocked or queued response work" ya
  su name terminal statuses excluded ob ve text "accepted" "failed" ya
  su name audience identity ob text "chief of staff" ya
  su name tie-break fields ob ve text "category precedence" "normalized deadline (missing last)" "existing numeric work priority (descending)" "evidence timestamp (missing last)" "stable identity (locale-independent lexical)" ya
  su name source evidence required ob ve text "source identity" "source locator" ya
  su name integration states ob ve text "reconciliation" "conflict" ya
prah

exists su name headquarters briefing policy be export ya
